WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.695
(logo whooshes)

00:00:01.695 --> 00:00:02.528
(hinge squeaks)

00:00:02.528 --> 00:00:06.278
(bright instrumental music)

00:00:08.113 --> 00:00:10.556
- [Woman] When I play games
on my phone, I turn the volume

00:00:10.556 --> 00:00:13.553
way up because it confuses my cat.

00:00:13.553 --> 00:00:15.531
- [Man] My dog hates when
I use her as a pillow

00:00:15.531 --> 00:00:17.297
but will always me as one.

00:00:17.297 --> 00:00:19.414
I'm sure my head is not that heavy.

00:00:19.414 --> 00:00:21.385
- [Woman] My dog is scared of my vibrator

00:00:21.385 --> 00:00:23.655
so when she bugs me, I
chase her around the house

00:00:23.655 --> 00:00:24.653
with it on.

00:00:24.653 --> 00:00:27.344
- [Man] Sometimes I make
strange obnoxious noises

00:00:27.344 --> 00:00:29.002
just to annoy my cats.

00:00:29.002 --> 00:00:31.135
- [Woman] My dog hates
when I have wet hair.

00:00:31.135 --> 00:00:33.956
He looks at me like I'm
really offending him.

00:00:33.956 --> 00:00:36.052
- [Man] My dog knows when
I'm taking a pic of him

00:00:36.052 --> 00:00:37.221
and he hates it.

00:00:37.221 --> 00:00:39.454
- [Woman] I torture my dog
by eating a cheeseburger

00:00:39.454 --> 00:00:42.527
really slow, she stares
at me the whole time.

00:00:42.527 --> 00:00:44.387
- [Man] My cat gets annoyed when I laugh

00:00:44.387 --> 00:00:46.616
and it's weirdly hilarious and adorable.

00:00:46.616 --> 00:00:48.463
- [Woman] When I can't
sleep, I bother my dog

00:00:48.463 --> 00:00:50.337
to make sure she stays awake with me.

00:00:50.337 --> 00:00:52.395
It's not fair that she
gets to sleep and I can't.

00:00:52.395 --> 00:00:54.378
- [Man] I torture my dog
by putting him in a room

00:00:54.378 --> 00:00:56.392
with a see-through door
and petting my other dog

00:00:56.392 --> 00:00:58.450
right in front of him, he hates it,

00:00:58.450 --> 00:01:00.885
and I know I'm a bad
person but it's funny.

00:01:00.885 --> 00:01:03.489
- [Woman] I watch musicals
with my dog and sing to her.

00:01:03.489 --> 00:01:04.696
She hates it.

00:01:04.696 --> 00:01:07.525
- [Man] I started setting
alarms around three and 4 a.m.,

00:01:07.525 --> 00:01:10.209
just to get up and wake
up and annoy my cat.

00:01:10.209 --> 00:01:11.490
He hates me and wakes me up

00:01:11.490 --> 00:01:13.545
around eight and nine every morning.

00:01:13.545 --> 00:01:14.472
It's a battle.

00:01:14.472 --> 00:01:18.389
(whimsical instrumental music)

00:01:22.072 --> 00:01:25.120
(logo whooshes)
(hinge squeaks)

